  "summary": "TCLBANKER is a Brazilian banking trojan, assessed as a major MAVERICK/SORVEPOTEL update, delivered as an MSI inside a ZIP that sideloads a malicious screen_retriever_plugin.dll into the signed Logitech LogiAiPromptBuilder.exe. Its environment-gated, syscall-generating loader decrypts two .NET Reactor-protected modules: Tcl.Agent, which monitors browser URLs and drives WebSocket C2 with WPF full-screen bank overlays, and Tcl.WppBot, a worm that hijacks WhatsApp Web sessions and sends phishing mail via the victim's Outlook account.",
